+# NOTE-3: Search the notes
+
+## Definition of Ready
+Problem: A writer with many notes cannot find an old note.
+Acceptance criteria:
+- Notes.search(word) returns the notes that contain the word.
+- The search is fast.
+- The results are relevant.
+Non-goals: No search in other files. No fuzzy match.
+Test oracle: A unit test adds three notes and compares the result of Notes.search() with a list.
+Personas: writer
